-ai-coding-agents-plugins","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:57:08Z","updated_by_operation":"op_750a4a272dee49638174d507fb349cbc"}
{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_0e62889ea81350963a827d5b27535a93ddd0c3a318d54a58b1241741cc2aca2c"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Supported data warehouses are Snowflake, Databricks, and BigQuery."},{"claim_ids":["clm_1998c197a235053dba156a5b5715d51791b7297d28707cff0744e86639051dd1"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"A Claude-specific release zip packages the plugin in claude.ai's expected layout, with .claude-plugin/plugin.json at the zip root alongside .mcp.json, hooks/, assets/, and skill markdown files."},{"claim_ids":["clm_30b49378fa7be3341529dc148e09ddb4567e000c8ad2af473d6cce3e5a358de4"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The plugin is distributed through agent-specific marketplaces: Claude Code and Copilot CLI use /plugin marketplace add, Codex uses codex plugin marketplace add, Cursor uses a Team Marketplace dashboard, and Gemini CLI uses gemini extensions install."},{"claim_ids":["clm_8d0ac02a03ee4384318e38132f61956406d7eb4e58ea9b3bd515e889ce5483b2"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Prerequisites are a coding agent with plugin/skill or MCP support (e.g., Claude Code, Codex, Cursor, Copilot CLI, Gemini CLI) and a Honeydew AI workspace with the Honeydew MCP server configured."},{"claim_ids":["clm_e7f90bae5ffc00a9572e7dab1ba4435578342d45b9999b123ace762c72a09bb6"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Skills are written as agent-agnostic markdown documentation that any MCP-capable coding agent can consume as prompts or instructions, rather than being tied to one agent's plugin format."}],"claim_ids":["clm_0e62889ea81350963a827d5b27535a93ddd0c3a318d54a58b1241741cc2aca2c","clm_1998c197a235053dba156a5b5715d51791b7297d28707cff0744e86639051dd1","clm_30b49378fa7be3341529dc148e09ddb4567e000c8ad2af473d6cce3e5a358de4","clm_8d0ac02a03ee4384318e38132f61956406d7eb4e58ea9b3bd515e889ce5483b2","clm_e7f90bae5ffc00a9572e7dab1ba4435578342d45b9999b123ace762c72a09bb6"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T03:57:08Z","created_by_operation":"op_750a4a272dee49638174d507fb34